 "composed_record": "the record of a composed answer, over its components of two or more nodes (a single node satisfies the constraint exactly, at every depth): green iff every one is; axioms@D at the least depth among them; crystalline_only@D (no spec) if one is, at the least such depth; a component's axiom_mismatch@D is carried (D36).  An acyclic quiver \u2014 every component a single node \u2014 is answered `green`, its source/sink order, and its S satisfies the constraint at every depth by \u00a71.2, a theorem",
